sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Person
    participant C as Assistant
    participant M as vecforge mcp
    participant V as Vault
    C->>M: start (stdio)
    M->>V: open, load snapshot
    C->>M: initialize, list tools
    U->>C: Remember I prefer<br/>short answers
    C->>M: remember(...)
    M->>V: dedup and store
    M-->>C: memory id
    Note over C,V: session ends, snapshot saved
    U->>C: New chat, days later
    C->>M: context_pack(query)
    M->>V: summary + top memories
    M-->>C: briefing
    C-->>U: Short answer
